import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 441 | Dragon Ball · Angel Setting Critique: A Higher Tier of Gift-System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 441 | Dragon Ball · Angel Setting Critique: A Higher Tier of Gift-System","no":441,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Angel","Whis","Gift-System","Grand Minister","Myriad-Ranks Republicanism"],"related":["49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances","20-Anchor Structure and Hierarchy","05-Myriad-Ranks Co-Progression Program"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0441_模块2-龙珠-天使设定批判-更高层级的恩赐制.md","filePath":"en/0441_模块2-龙珠-天使设定批判-更高层级的恩赐制.md"}'),s={name:"en/0441_模块2-龙珠-天使设定批判-更高层级的恩赐制.md"};function a(r,e,l,h,d,g){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-441-dragon-ball-·-angel-setting-critique-a-higher-tier-of-gift-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 441 | Dragon Ball · Angel Setting Critique: A Higher Tier of Gift-System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-441-dragon-ball-·-angel-setting-critique-a-higher-tier-of-gift-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 441 | Dragon Ball · Angel Setting Critique: A Higher Tier of Gift-System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 10) | Benchmark base: Documents 49, 20, 05</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-above-the-observer-who-is-there" tabindex="-1">Introduction: above the observer, who is there? <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-above-the-observer-who-is-there" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: above the observer, who is there?&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The God of Destruction is already dictatorship; the Angel Whis is stronger than the God of Destruction, yet only acts as &quot;observer&quot; — this design looks like checks and balances, but actually roots dictatorship deeper: Angels do not govern, do not legislate, only step in when the God of Destruction runs out of control, and Angels themselves are appointed by the Grand Minister, who serves beside Zeno. The whole power chain has no link elected by Myriad Ranks. This entry, by the law-first axiom and republican axiom of Myriad Races, dissects how the Angel setting pushes &quot;gift-system&quot; to a higher tier.</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Angels&#39; energy level is second only to the Grand Minister and Zeno in Dragon Ball worldview, but its direction is equally wasted:</p><ul><li><strong>Only spar, not build</strong>: Whis sparring with Goku and Vegeta is essentially putting cosmos-second-tier energy to private sparring; never makes &quot;Ultra Instinct&quot; theory public to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Only supervise, not govern</strong>: the Angel&#39;s duty is &quot;watch the God of Destruction not get too out of line,&quot; but Whis basically does nothing about Beerus smashing planets — supervision exists in name only</li><li><strong>Only spectate, not legislate</strong>: the Angel clan never legislates, never educates, never saves Myriad Ranks — their existence itself is &quot;higher-ranked bystanders&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How Angel gift-system feeds historical regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Knowledge monopoly</strong>: Ultra Instinct, god-ki theory only transmitted within Angels; Myriad Ranks have not even popularized &quot;ki&quot; basics</li><li><strong>Supervision hollow</strong>: Angels supervise the God of Destruction, but Angels themselves are not supervised — top of power chain unaccountable</li><li><strong>Myriad Ranks have no upward channel</strong>: Angels are &quot;children born by father Grand Minister&quot;; lineage closed; Myriad Ranks however hardworking cannot become Angels</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s predatory thinking in his relationship with Angels:</p><ul><li><strong>Mentor-gift monopoly</strong>: Whis willing to spar with Goku is a cosmos-tier gift; but Goku never asks Whis to make Ultra Instinct theory public — he defaults &quot;I was chosen because I am special&quot;</li><li><strong>Spectating Myriad Ranks&#39; suffering</strong>: Whis watches Frieza destroy Namek, watches Cell Game kill people, watches Buu destroy Earth, the whole way spectating — this &quot;transcendence&quot; is essentially indifference to Myriad Ranks&#39; suffering</li><li><strong>Taking Angels as friends</strong>: Goku chats and laughs with Whis, never questions &quot;why didn&#39;t you save those dead people&quot; — this is the gifted&#39;s structural dependence on the patron</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball Angel Gift-System</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Angel lineage closed</td><td>Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage: any race has qualification to participate in top-tier governance</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge monopoly</td><td>300 Origin cultivation systems fully open; Ultra-Instinct-tier theory textbook-ified</td></tr><tr><td>Supervision hollow</td><td>Anchor Inspection Committee + Symbiotic Court; supervisors also supervised</td></tr><tr><td>Only spectate, not save</td><td>Causal self-discipline axiom: strong ones seeing Myriad Ranks&#39; suffering must observe first then limited interference</td></tr><tr><td>Goku chosen</td><td>20% activation strategy: strong ones emerge in batches; not by &quot;being chosen by an Angel&quot;</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Angel power chain — Grand Minister → universe Angels → Gods of Destruction → Supreme Kais</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;if Angels elected by Myriad-Ranks parliament, ten-thousand-year term, knowledge fully public&quot; control</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count Myriad-Ranks cultivation knowledge popularization rate, God-of-Destruction abuse-of-power times, cosmos-tier disaster mortality</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Angel Gift-System Cost Report</em>, quantifying &quot;if Ultra Instinct theory made public, how much Myriad-Ranks overall combat power can rise&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: low</strong>. Angel &quot;neutral non-interference&quot; principle repeatedly broken in plot (Whis saving Vegeta, Angels spectating Tournament of Power); principle changes with plot</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Grand Minister&#39;s strength, Angels&#39; total number, Angels&#39; father setting repeatedly adjusted between Super and Heroes</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high (gift-style-leaning-oligarchic)</strong>. Goku chosen by Whis to train is Dragon Ball version of &quot;the chosen one&quot;</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cosmos-second energy only for private sparring; knowledge zero public</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Ultra-Instinct-tier knowledge monopolized by Angel clan</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least opened mid-low-tier cultivation; Dragon Ball did not even make mid-low-tier public, more closed</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Angel lineage closed; Myriad Ranks have no upward channel</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Angels&#39; &quot;higher dimension&quot; is only a higher layer of closed pyramid, not open multiverse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Angel setting looks like a &quot;supervise the God of Destruction&quot; checks-and-balances design, but actually roots dictatorship deeper — supervisors not supervised; knowledge monopolists monopolize knowledge. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants to ask: if Whis is really that strong, why did he not stop Frieza from destroying Namek? The answer is cruel in Dragon Ball worldview: because that was plot. But in Heng Yuan Zhou, &quot;strong ones seeing Myriad Ranks&#39; suffering must observe first then limited interference&quot; is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s hard requirement — the strong one&#39;s spectating is itself dereliction of duty.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · Angel setting critique · a higher tier of gift-system described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./440_模块2-龙珠-破坏神设定批判-宇宙级存在的个人独裁.html">Entry 440 · God of Destruction</a> · <a href="./442_模块2-龙珠-全王设定批判-终极存在的随意性.html">Entry 442 · Zeno Setting</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/20-锚点结构与层级.html">20-Anchor Structure and Hierarchy</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const p=t(s,[["render",a]]);export{u as __pageData,p as default};
